    "text": "A sample of an ideal gas is taken through the cyclic process <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> as shown in the figure. The change in the internal energy of the gas along the path <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> is <math><mo>-</mo><mn>180</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The gas absorbs <math><mn>250</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> of heat along the path <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> and <math><mn>60</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> along the path <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> . The work done by the gas along the path <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> is:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/40aa1f1d-923a-40a8-af0b-5579107d3bc1-image24.png\" />",
