    "text": "In a cyclic process, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  <br/>From 1st law of thermodynamics <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>  <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></ma